{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y把部分关键的心理因果和自我说服过程压缩得太短，尤其S06、S10、S11不如X交代得完整，而且个别段落的感受词仍然偏密。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的短句、放大加亮的关键词和按音乐时点出现的感受，让我边听边扫时更容易抓住当下的心理变化；身体反应、声音、动作和情绪的细微转折也更具体。X的优势是把为什么舍不得、为什么不敢回去、又为什么决定继续往前过的因果讲得更充分，前后像一段连续的内心挣扎；Y有时会被密集的感受切碎这条线。综合实际观看体验，我选Y，但不是因为它提供的信息更多，而是因为它更容易让我在对应的音乐时刻接收到有层次的感受。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "48c851e0-dee8-402b-9de0-b677055c024d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T060037386646Z", "elapsed_seconds": 44.266, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T06:01:21.667260+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b510474a900debf687ddd55f430ec16d131c523c82626417b74f0a15a235674f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "